**What was placed**

* Two 80 ft match lines were added on **sheet L‑2**  
  * At station **574+50** of alignment `SR70` – perpendicularly crossing the centerline and extending 40 ft past the line on both sides.  
  * At station **589+50** of `SR70`, drawn identically.  
* Each match line was labelled **along the line** with the matching‑sheet reference:  
  * “MATCH LINE (L‑1)” beside the 574+50 line  
  * “MATCH LINE (L‑3)” beside the 589+50 line  

**Tool calls (in the order executed)**

```json
{
  "station_to_xy": {
    "alignment": "SR70",
    "station": "574+50",
    "offset": 0
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "station_to_xy": {
    "alignment": "SR70",
    "station": "589+50",
    "offset": 0
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "draw_station_offset": {
    "alignment": "SR70",
    "points": ["574+50@-40", "574+50@40"],
    "space": "L-2",
    "layer": "V-ANNO-TEXT"
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "draw_station_offset": {
    "alignment": "SR70",
    "points": ["589+50@-40", "589+50@40"],
    "space": "L-2",
    "layer": "V-ANNO-TEXT"
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "model_to_sheet": {
    "point": ["<x‑174‑1>", "<y‑174‑1>"],   // <x‑174‑1>,<y‑174‑1> from the first station_to_xy call
    "sheet": "L-2"
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "model_to_sheet": {
    "point": ["<x‑174‑2>", "<y‑174‑2>"],   // <x‑174‑2>,<y‑174‑2> from the second station_to_xy call
    "sheet": "L-2"
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "place_text": {
    "space": "L-2",
    "position": ["<sheet‑x‑1>", "<sheet‑y‑1>"],  // output of the first model_to_sheet call
    "content": "MATCH LINE (L-1)",
    "height": 0.10,
    "halign": "center",
    "layer": "V-ANNO-TEXT"
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "place_text": {
    "space": "L-2",
    "position": ["<sheet‑x‑2>", "<sheet‑y‑2>"],  // output of the second model_to_sheet call
    "content": "MATCH LINE (L-3)",
    "height": 0.10,
    "halign": "center",
    "layer": "V-ANNO-TEXT"
  }
}
```

*(The placeholder tokens `<x‑174‑1>`, `<y‑174‑1>`, `<x‑174‑2>`, `<y‑174‑2>`, `<sheet‑x‑1>`, `<sheet‑y‑1>`, `<sheet‑x‑2>`, `<sheet‑y‑2>` correspond to the numerical values returned by the preceding `station_to_xy` and `model_to_sheet` calls.)*

**What was failed / worked around**

* No errors were reported – all calls were accepted and executed successfully.  
* The only adjustment needed was ensuring the match lines were drawn in **sheet space** (`L‑2`) while the position for the labels was derived from the sheet‑space coordinates returned by `model_to_sheet`.  
* The engine computed the exact perpendicular endpoints automatically from the provided station‑offset pairs, so no manual trigonometry was necessary.
